 Request Information:</b></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><p><b>CR Subject:</b>&nbsp;Depend on</p></li>\r\n<li><p><b>CR Description:</b>&nbsp;3</p></li>\r\n<li><p><b>Requester:</b> hanan.megawer</p></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Thank you in advance for your prompt action.</p><hr><p><i><span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">Note:</span>&nbsp;This is an automated message sent by the IT TMS System.</i></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">Best regards,</span><br><span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">TMS</span></p>', '[\"hanan.megawer@te.eg\"]', '[]', '[\"ahmed.o.hasan@te.eg\"]', 'queued', NULL, NULL, 0, 'App\\Models\\Change_request', 31301, '2025-12-29 13:11:28', '2025-12-29 13:11:28');
