equest Information:</b></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><p><b>CR Subject:</b>&nbsp;Test-subject</p></li>\r\n<li><p><b>CR Description:</b>&nbsp;Te-Pentest</p></li>\r\n<li><p><b>Requester:</b> security.test.1</p></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Thank you in advance for your prompt action.</p><hr><p><i><span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">Note:</span>&nbsp;This is an automated message sent by the IT TMS System.</i></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">Best regards,</span><br><span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">TMS</span></p>', '[\"amr.m.abdelhamid@te.eg\"]', '[]', '[\"ahmed.o.hasan@te.eg\"]', 'queued', NULL, NULL, 0, 'App\\Models\\Change_request', 31303, '2025-12-29 15:27:21', '2025-12-29 15:27:21');
